### 查询订阅（getSubscriptions）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/getSubscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US"}

### 按类型查询订阅（getSubscription）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/getSubscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"notificationType":"ORDER_CHANGE"}}

### 创建订阅（createSubscription）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/createSubscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"notificationType":"ORDER_CHANGE"},"body":{"payloadVersion":"1.0","destinationId":"DESTINATION-ID"}}

### 按编号查询订阅（getSubscriptionById）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/getSubscriptionById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"notificationType":"ORDER_CHANGE","subscriptionId":"SUBSCRIPTION-ID"}}

### 删除订阅（deleteSubscriptionById）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/deleteSubscriptionById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"notificationType":"ORDER_CHANGE","subscriptionId":"SUBSCRIPTION-ID"}}

### 发送测试通知（sendTestNotification）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/sendTestNotification
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"notificationType":"ORDER_CHANGE"},"body":{"payloadVersion":"1.0"}}

### 查询通知目标（getDestinations）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/getDestinations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US"}

### 创建通知目标（createDestination）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/createDestination
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"name":"order-change-sqs","resource":{"sqs":{"arn":"arn:aws:sqs:us-east-1:123456789012:order-change"}},"deliveryChannel":{"sqs":{"arn":"arn:aws:sqs:us-east-1:123456789012:order-change"}}}}

### 查询通知目标（getDestination）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/getDestination
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"destinationId":"DESTINATION-ID"}}

### 删除通知目标（deleteDestination）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/notifications/operations/deleteDestination
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"destinationId":"DESTINATION-ID"}}
